Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] build: restrict the top-level Kbuild to
 drivers/gpu/mediatek/

Build plumbing only. The GQ5012BF1 GPU reconstruction builds the four
kernel_device_modules GPU modules (ged, mtk_gpu_hal, mtk_gpu_qos,
mtk_gpufreq_wrapper + mtk_gpufreq_mt6878) as an isolated external-module
build, so every other obj-y directory is dropped from the top Kbuild.
Stock MediaTek built the whole tree; this changes object selection only,
not the flags or sources of the GPU objects (proved by byte-identical
output against stock).
---
 Kbuild | 49 -------------------------------------------------
 1 file changed, 49 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Kbuild b/Kbuild
index 8f7faae..d8b6838 100644
--- a/Kbuild
+++ b/Kbuild
@@ -8,104 +8,55 @@ subdir-ccflags-y += -Werror \
 		-I$(srctree)/$(src)/include \
